        "created_at": "2013-08-21T13:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wasn't really thinking about the details.</p>\n<p>Edit: Would this fix the issue?</p>\n<p>At the start of their turn, <span class=\"bbcode-b\"> if any heroes are incapacitated </span>, a surviving hero may deal themself any number of psycic(a diffrent type would be ok, but psycic seemes best) damage. If they do, revive an incapacitated hero with x hp, where x is the amount of damage dealt to that hero this way minus (H - 1)</p>",
