        "id": 61940,
        "name": "brytehfryguy",
        "username": "brytehfryguy",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/f0a364/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-21T16:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Speaking of Fanatic, wouldn't she be able to ressurect someone to full health if she had Breastplate in play and was willing to lose it?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You do take damage into negatives, if anyone figured that might solve the problem.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Actually, I guess the issue is anyone who is almost dead could just take absurd amounts of damage to restore someone else to life with full.</p>",
