        "created_at": "2013-08-21T17:23:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Discard may work better than damage.&nbsp; Especially when Twist the Ether comes into play.&nbsp; Zero could deal himself HP-1 Psychic (converted to Fire) and then heal that much (potentially +1 more with Focused Apertures) by dealing the resulting Cold damage caused by Isothermic Transducer to himself with the Null-Point Calibration Unit in play.&nbsp; With Vis, that would make him THE healer character.</p>",
